    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><div><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Size\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">当你从至少离地10尺的高度坠落时，你可以用你的反应展开你的翼膜，水平滑行一段等同于你步行速度的距离（其方向由你决定），本次摔落对你造成的伤害变为0。</span></p></div></div></div><p>When you fall at least 10 feet above the ground, you can use your reaction to extend your skin membranes to glide horizontally a number of feet equal to your walking speed, and you take 0 damage from the fall. You determine the direction of the glide.</p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
